{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++14 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++14 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nusing ull = unsigned long long;\n\nconst int MAXN = 250010;\n\nint n, k, p, lim;\nint pc[MAXN];\null fact[MAXN], invfact[MAXN], powv, total;\nunordered_map<unsigned long long, ull> memo;\n\null mod_pow(ull base, int expo) {\n    ull res = 1;\n    while (expo > 0) {\n        if (expo & 1) res = res * base % p;\n        base = base * base % p;\n        expo >>= 1;\n    }\n    return res;\n}\n\null comb(int N, int M) {\n    return fact[N] * invfact[M] % p * invfact[N - M] % p;\n}\n\null dfs(int K, int N) {\n    if (pc[N] < K) return 0;\n    if (K == 1) return invfact[N];\n\n    unsigned long long key = (unsigned long long)K * 300000ULL + (unsigned)N;\n    auto it = memo.find(key);\n    if (it != memo.end()) return it->second;\n\n    ull cur = 0;\n    int cnt = 0;\n    for (int sub = N & (N - 1); sub; sub = N & (sub - 1)) {\n        if (pc[sub] >= K - 1) {\n            cur += dfs(K - 1, sub) * invfact[N ^ sub];\n            if (++cnt == 18) {\n                cnt = 0;\n                cur %= p;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    cur %= p;\n    memo.emplace(key, cur);\n    return cur;\n}\n\nint main() {\n#ifndef ONLINE_JUDGE\n    freopen(\"255x.in\", \"r\", stdin);\n    freopen(\"255x.out\", \"w\", stdout);\n#endif\n\n    if (scanf(\"%d%d%d\", &n, &k, &p) != 3) return 0;\n\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) pc[i] = pc[i >> 1] + (i & 1);\n\n    powv = mod_pow(k, n);\n    if (n & 1) {\n        printf(\"%d\\n\", powv);\n        return 0;\n    }\n\n    lim = min(k, pc[n]);\n\n    fact[0] = 1;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) fact[i] = fact[i - 1] * i % p;\n\n    invfact[n] = mod_pow(fact[n], p - 2);\n    for (int i = n; i >= 1; --i) invfact[i - 1] = invfact[i] * i % p;\n\n    total = 0;\n    for (int i = lim; i >= 1; --i) total += comb(k, i) * dfs(i, n);\n\n    ull ans = (powv - total % p * fact[n] % p + p) % p;\n    printf(\"%lld\\n\", ans);\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static final int MAXN = 250010;\n    static int n, k, p, lim;\n    static int[] pc = new int[MAXN];\n    static long[] fact = new long[MAXN];\n    static long[] invfact = new long[MAXN];\n    static long powv, total;\n    static HashMap<Long, Long> memo = new HashMap<>();\n\n    static long modPow(long base, int expo) {\n        long res = 1;\n        while (expo > 0) {\n            if ((expo & 1) == 1) res = res * base % p;\n            base = base * base % p;\n            expo >>= 1;\n        }\n        return res;\n    }\n\n    static long comb(int N, int M) {\n        return fact[N] * invfact[M] % p * invfact[N - M] % p;\n    }\n\n    static long dfs(int K, int N) {\n        if (pc[N] < K) return 0;\n        if (K == 1) return invfact[N];\n\n        long key = (long)K * 300000L + N;\n        Long cached = memo.get(key);\n        if (cached != null) return cached;\n\n        long cur = 0;\n        int cnt = 0;\n        for (int sub = N & (N - 1); sub != 0; sub = N & (sub - 1)) {\n            if (pc[sub] >= K - 1) {\n                cur += dfs(K - 1, sub) * invfact[N ^ sub];\n                if (++cnt == 18) {\n                    cnt = 0;\n                    cur %= p;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        cur %= p;\n        memo.put(key, cur);\n        return cur;\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        StringTokenizer st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        n = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        k = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        p = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n            pc[i] = pc[i >> 1] + (i & 1);\n        }\n\n        powv = modPow(k, n);\n        if ((n & 1) == 1) {\n            System.out.println(powv);\n            return;\n        }\n\n        lim = Math.min(k, pc[n]);\n\n        fact[0] = 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n            fact[i] = fact[i - 1] * i % p;\n        }\n\n        invfact[n] = modPow(fact[n], p - 2);\n        for (int i = n; i >= 1; --i) {\n            invfact[i - 1] = invfact[i] * i % p;\n        }\n\n        total = 0;\n        for (int i = lim; i >= 1; --i) {\n            total += comb(k, i) * dfs(i, n);\n        }\n\n        long ans = (powv - total % p * fact[n] % p + p) % p;\n        System.out.println(ans);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00014351768186315894, -3.659658250398934e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.25192978978157043, -0.20145104825496674, 0.0, 0.0, -2.264974000354414e-06, -5.9126061387360096e-05, -1.5139465176616795e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.011461719870567322, -0.0024839758407324553, -7.772143726469949e-05, -0.038085710257291794, -0.5979923605918884, -0.00012337400403339416, -3.099436753473128e-06, -